{"id":13299,"author":"Newcleus","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eHello all!\u003cbr\u003eI decided to kick off my career with a revival of the Staff Spotlight series, and I decided to start it off with one of our most hardworking and dedicated staff members,\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003ePelpelajax.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e1. What is your username in minecraft and what is your favorite game on Avicus?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eHello, my username is Pelpelajax, and I recently changed it too Aeronautic_. My favourite game on Avicus is CTW however the CTW server are often empty, unfortunately.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e2. What are you most excited/obsessed over at the moment?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eAt the moment, I am most obsessed over the tournament. It’s something we have been planning for a while now. There is still some things to get done, but the foundations are there. Very pleased.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e3. Where are you from?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eI am from the Netherlands, Rotterdam. I moved to England when I was 9 so, I feel a bit English as well.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e4. Are you in school, or do you have a job? \u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eI am in school, 8th grade. I will soon be going to 9th grade. I do occasionally give football training to younger kids, but that’s not really a job.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e5. Who or what inspires you the most in your life?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eMhm, that’s a very good question, one that I have never thought of. It would probably be a football player. Edwin van den Sar. He’s a dutch goalkeeper, the best we have ever had. He was a great success with Manchester United, the team I support. He is someone I look up too. Someone else is my grandad. He is a very funny and caring guy. Someone who you can always laugh with.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e6. How do you contribute to the Avicus as a staff member?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eI contribute to Avicus as a\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Senior Staff member and Official. I often go through the the support email and appeals, as well as creating tournaments that you can enjoy. I help out where I can, I don’t regret anything on Avicus one but. It’s been a great time so far.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e7. What are the most common questions you get asked while moderating or managing?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eWell, it would be ‘When do staff applications open’ or ‘When’s the tournament’. Even refs ask me that, shame on you refs.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e8. Anything else you want to mention?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eWell, I am 14, and have spend just under a year on Avicus. I am a goalkeeper and play in the second team of my age group. I love planes and want to do something with them when I am older. That will be all for now. Thank you for reading and have a great day/night!\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eHello all!\u003cbr\u003eI decided to kick off my career with a revival of the Staff Spotlight series, and I decided to start it off with one of our most hardworking and dedicated staff members,\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003ePelpelajax.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e1. What is your username in minecraft and what is your favorite game on Avicus?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eHello, my username is Pelpelajax, and I recently changed it too Aeronautic_. My favourite game on Avicus is CTW however the CTW server are often empty, unfortunately.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e2. What are you most excited/obsessed over at the moment?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eAt the moment, I am most obsessed over the tournament. It’s something we have been planning for a while now. There is still some things to get done, but the foundations are there. Very pleased.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e3. Where are you from?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eI am from the Netherlands, Rotterdam. I moved to England when I was 9 so, I feel a bit English as well.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e4. Are you in school, or do you have a job? \u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eI am in school, 8th grade. I will soon be going to 9th grade. I do occasionally give football training to younger kids, but that’s not really a job.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e5. Who or what inspires you the most in your life?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eMhm, that’s a very good question, one that I have never thought of. It would probably be a football player. Edwin van den Sar. He’s a dutch goalkeeper, the best we have ever had. He was a great success with Manchester United, the team I support. He is someone I look up too. Someone else is my grandad. He is a very funny and caring guy. Someone who you can always laugh with.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e6. How do you contribute to the Avicus as a staff member?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eI contribute to Avicus as a\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Senior Staff member and Official. I often go through the the support email and appeals, as well as creating tournaments that you can enjoy. I help out where I can, I don’t regret anything on Avicus one but. It’s been a great time so far.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e7. What are the most common questions you get asked while moderating or managing?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eWell, it would be ‘When do staff applications open’ or ‘When’s the tournament’. Even refs ask me that, shame on you refs.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e8. Anything else you want to mention?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: -9999px; display: inline-block; height: 0px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eWell, I am 14, and have spend just under a year on Avicus. I am a goalkeeper and play in the second team of my age group. I love planes and want to do something with them when I am older. That will be all for now. Thank you for reading and have a great day/night!\u003c/span\u003e","created_at":1430677836,"title":"Staff Spotlight Comeback #2 - Pelpelajax","replies":[{"id":185697,"author":"Vobaseball12","body":"Pel!","body_tagged":"Pel!","created_at":1430677930},{"id":185700,"author":"Lavish","body":"Hala Van der Sar!","body_tagged":"Hala Van der Sar!","created_at":1430678097},{"id":185701,"author":"nintendoboy11","body":"Nice pel!","body_tagged":"Nice pel!","created_at":1430678151},{"id":185702,"author":"SavageAmericans","body":"Wait, what was the first one \u0026lt;.\u0026lt;","body_tagged":"Wait, what was the first one \u0026lt;.\u0026lt;","created_at":1430678214},{"id":185706,"author":"IamSUPERMAN2007","body":"psv is the best\u003cbr\u003elike and comment if u agree","body_tagged":"psv is the best\u003cbr\u003elike and comment if u agree","created_at":1430678542},{"id":185708,"author":"JDKL","body":"That's awesome!","body_tagged":"That's awesome!","created_at":1430678622},{"id":185713,"author":"RIP_Avicus","body":"Oh Man United?\u003cbr\u003eChelsea just won the league\u003cbr\u003e#justsayin ;)","body_tagged":"Oh Man United?\u003cbr\u003eChelsea just won the league\u003cbr\u003e#justsayin ;)","created_at":1430679114},{"id":185719,"author":"Legoman2302","body":"Pel!! Nice dude","body_tagged":"Pel!! Nice dude","created_at":1430679862},{"id":185720,"author":"ClubberNugget","body":"When is the tournament? :P","body_tagged":"When is the tournament? :P","created_at":1430679911},{"id":185722,"author":"Robin_DD_J","body":"The best sr mod","body_tagge